<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust sets call warrants on China Light.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets call warrants on China Light.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International PLC said on Tuesday it has launched 58 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants are exercisable into one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$30.70    PREMIUM	   12.88 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$1.05     GEARING	   3.48X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	8 OCT 98    PAYDATE  2 to 3 weeks after launch</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG   MIN EXER LOT    5,000</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE	HK$36.50</p>
<p> NOTES	     GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
